# ft_package

A sample test package developed as part of the Python formatting and packaging exercises.

## Description

`ft_package` is a minimal Python package designed to demonstrate the standard creation, building, and installation workflow of a Python distribution using modern packaging tools (`pyproject.toml`). It includes a utility function to count occurrences of an item within a list.

## Installation

You can install the package locally using `pip` (or `uv pip`) from the generated distribution files. Both of the following commands are supported:

```bash
# Install using the source distribution
pip install ./dist/ft_package-0.0.1.tar.gz

# Install using the built distribution (Wheel)
pip install ./dist/ft_package-0.0.1-py3-none-any.whl
